-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
GitHub security advisories (license "CC-BY-4.0" in the feed)
Source: GitHub Advisory Database (https://github.com/advisories) and the security
advisories of the repositories named in the catalog, read through the GitHub
REST API.
License: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International,
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/ (see
https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/main/LICENSE.md).
Attribution: GitHub, Inc. and the advisory authors; each advisory links its
GitHub advisory page. Changes: records are trimmed, normalized to the Advisorydeck
schema and merged with the CVE record of the same vulnerability; version ranges
are rewritten as described in docs/ingest.md.

data/sources/ghsa/ holds trimmed copies of these advisories.

