-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
CISA Known Exploited Vulnerabilities catalog (license "CC0-1.0" in the feed)
Source: Cybersecurity and Infrastructure Security Agency,
https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog (JSON feed), mirrored
at https://github.com/cisagov/kev-data
License: CC0 1.0 Universal, https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/
Used: the CVE id and the date each CVE was added.

data/sources/kev/ holds that list.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
EPSS scores (license "FIRST-EPSS" in the feed)
Source: FIRST, Exploit Prediction Scoring System, https://www.first.org/epss/,
read through https://api.first.org/data/v1/epss
Terms: free to use, no registration; attribution is requested.
Attribution: EPSS scores are provided by FIRST.org, Inc.

data/sources/epss/ holds the scores of the CVEs in the feed.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
NVD (license "NVD-TOU" in the feed)
Source: National Vulnerability Database, NIST, https://nvd.nist.gov, read through
the NVD API 2.0, only for CVEs that neither the CNA nor GitHub scored.
Terms: https://nvd.nist.gov/developers/terms-of-use

This product uses data from the NVD API but is not endorsed or certified by the
NVD.

data/sources/nvd/ holds the CVSS metrics read.
